          "title": "You'll want to know: چائے خانہ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چائے خانہ — chāe khānā — \"a tea house\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The phrase, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "چائے خانہ (chāe khānā) is \"tea house\". chāe, \"tea\", came through Persian chāy from Chinese chá, and khānā is Persian khāna, \"house, room\"."
