              "text": "گرجا گھر (girjā ghar) is \"church house\". girjā is usually traced to Portuguese igreja, \"church\". ghar, \"house\", is inherited; it is usually taken as a popular form of Sanskrit gṛha, a link CDIAL calls phonetically difficult (CDIAL 4428)."
